TITLE      Large Beta-Delayed Neutron Emission Probabilities in
           the 78Ni Region
AUTHOR     (J.A.Winger,S.V.Ilyushkin,K.P.Rykaczewski,C.J.Gross,
           J.C.Batchelder,C.Goodin,R.Grzywacz,J.H.Hamilton,
           A.Korgul,W.Krolas,S.N.Liddick,C.Mazzocchi,S.Padgett,
           A.Piechaczek,M.M.Rajabali,D.Shapira,E.F.Zganjar,
           I.N.Borzov)
REFERENCE  (J,PRL,102,142502,2009)
           #doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.102.142502
INSTITUTE  (1USAMSS,1USAORL,1USAVBT,3POLWWA,3POLIFJ,2ITYMIL,
           1USALSU,2GERGSI)
FACILITY   (CYCLO,1USAORL) The Holifield Radioactive Ion Beam
           Facility (HRIBF) at Oak Ridge National Laboratory.
DETECTOR   (HPGE,SCIN) Four Ge clover detectors and two plastic
           beta detectors.
METHOD     (COINC) A new method combining high-resolution mass
           separation, reacceleration, and digital beta-gamma
           spectroscopy of 238U fission products.
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) No details on sources of uncertainties.
